    "detailed_description": "A tower defense game with brand new gameplay elements, innovatively combining the strategic tower defense with card battles. With dozens of different enemies, hundreds of unprecedented levels, monthly updated trial rankings, and rich holiday-themed events. All you need to do is constantly collect and synthesize cards, cultivate your own heroes and defensive towers, and you can drive the villains out of your homeland. Join this exciting tower defense battle now!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you can do in the game:</h2><strong>Beat up the bad guys</strong><br>Battle various types of enemies, from minotaurs to the undead, and even feathered demons!<br><br><strong>Upgrade your heroes</strong><br>Win new items with each victory and make your heroes stronger and even more brutal!<br><br><strong>Tower defense + card collection and upgrading</strong><br>The addictive depth of strategy and highly enjoyable card collecting mechanics will keep you hooked!<br><br><strong>Treasures and rewards galore</strong><br>Use a variety of tempting loot to enhance your combat power!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2>1.\tSimple and easy:to-understand towerdefense basics, easyto operate.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689970/extras/15ebbdeb57c3a1a11591558bb4656f5c.avif?t=1726762219\" width=620 height=349 /></span><br><br>2.\tExquisite cartoon-style graphics suitable for all ages.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689970/extras/21e89e16d8fa89204d57d701bc3ca075.avif?t=1726762219\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br><br>3.\tFreely combine battle strategies, choose different routes to strengthen your own combat power, whether it's towers, heroes, spells, etc.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689970/extras/339a6cff16bcef664432b68756ec229a.avif?t=1726762219\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br><br><br>4.\tRich enemies and levels for a deeply immersive gaming experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689970/extras/ce769022e6c41a908dbaaf9e937a0149.avif?t=1726762219\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br><br>5.\tRegularly updated leaderboard rankings and server-wide progress, you're not alone in the battle!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689970/extras/fd15ce3df0e6eb3f29066766883b8281.avif?t=1726762219\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br><br>6.\tRich and colorful holiday-themed events for continuous surprises.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689970/extras/0553b1eee43d5c06e5682bbea88b731b.avif?t=1726762219\" width=620 height=348 /></span>",
